<title>SRI LANKA: Three Acre rises on expansion plans.</title>
<headline>Three Acre rises on expansion plans.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A recent expansion announcement pushed up Three Acre Farms Ltd by 19.3 percent, or 5.50 rupees to 34 rupees, on retail buying of 300 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>The company, a supplier of day-old chicks, said on Thursday it was expanding operations at a cost of 280 million rupees by buying a firm which owns a piggery, hatchery and retail outlets.</p>
<p>&quot;Since word went round that the company was expanding operations, small retail investors have been searching for shares,&quot; said a broker specialising in retail trade.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
